  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Livelihoods for Youth (EL4Y) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action aims to contribute to the reduction of youth unemployment and to theiraccess to decent work in Rwanda. This overall objective will be achieved if the livelihoods of the 4,000 vulnerable youth (16-30 years, 70% females) are enhanced (Specific objective/outcome) through the increase of at least 60% of their income and control over resources by the end of the Actions period.</narrative>
  </description>
